{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T10:08:00.004499", "data": {"url": "https://www.tatasustainability.com/", "title": "Tata Sustainability Group - TATA Sustainability Group", "content": "About Us | Our Focus Areas | What's New | Resources | Sustainability at a Glance Image Source: Tata Motors Empowering Biodiversity Action Tata's six-step framework guides group companies with global standards, practical tools, and proven strategies. From planning to implementation - clarity, case studies, and best practices drive meaningful ecological stewardship. \u2014 Know more \u2014 Climate Change is Everybody\u2019s Business Climate Change has been a growing concern with the Tata group for several years. The Tata group is cognizant of the enormity of the challenge posed by climate change and acknowledges the role of Tata companies in working proactively towards combating climate change. \u2014 Read the full story \u2014 Thousand Schools Programme The Thousand Schools Programme was initiated by Tata Steel in January 2015, to revitalise school education in its areas of operation. The programme aims to create a model of Universalisation of Elementary Education (UEE) within the Right to Education (RTE) framework that is replicable and scalable. \u2014 Read the full story \u2014 July 12, 2024 Tata Group Ranked No. 1 on Sustainability in Asia Pacific by GlobeScan Sustainability Leaders Survey 2024 The Tata group leads peers like Swire, Mahindra & Mahindra and Samsung by a significant margin. 'Integration into business strategy', 'Demonstrating impacts' and 'Focusing on supply chains' were the top three drivers for recognising companies as leaders, underscoring Tata group's strategic focus on sustainability. \u2014 Read the news \u2014 United for Wayanad ONE Tata's swift response to the July 2024 disaster brought life-saving aid, shelter, and mental health support to thousands. Now building back stronger, with hope for a resilient future. \u2014 Know more \u2014 Tata Sustainability Conclave 2025 Tata Sustainability Conclave brings leaders and global experts together to advance tech-enabled solutions for a sustainable future - exploring innovation, enabling scale, and accelerating impact across critical environmental priorities. Tata Sustainability Conclave brings leaders and global experts together to advance tech-enabled solutions for a sustainable future - exploring innovation,... \u2014 Know more \u2014 Climate Change Water Circular Economy Biodiversity Community Initiatives Disaster Response Climate Change Water Circular Economy Biodiversity Community Initiatives Disaster Response TATA ENGAGE Enriching Communities by Volunteering Time & Skills Tata Engage, organised by the Tata Sustainability Group, brings together Tata companies on a common volunteering platform. \u2014 Be a Volunteer \u2014 Biodiversity Compendium Inspiring biodiversity stories from the Tata universe Download Publication Making Waves Inspiring stories on water management by Tata companies Download Publication Closing the Loop Circular economy in action at the Tata group Download Publication", "lists": [["Home", "About Us The Tata Group Tata Sustainability Group How We Approach Sustainability Contact Us", "The Tata Group", "Tata Sustainability Group", "How We Approach Sustainability", "Contact Us", "Environment Project Aalingana Climate Change & Energy Water Circular Economy Biodiversity", "Project Aalingana", "Climate Change & Energy", "Water", "Circular Economy", "Biodiversity", "Social Volunteering Disaster Response Human Rights Supply Chain Sustainability Safety & Diversity", "Volunteering", "Disaster Response", "Human Rights", "Supply Chain Sustainability", "Safety & Diversity", "Governance", "Advocacy", "Our Events Tata Sustainability Conclave Tata Sustainability Month", "Tata Sustainability Conclave", "Tata Sustainability Month", "Insights What\u2019s New Resources Video Gallery Tata Corner", "What\u2019s New", "Resources", "Video Gallery", "Tata Corner", "Login", ""], ["The 